      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "La acción de la tienda: cotizar por WhatsApp. Rojo de marca, 48 px (52 px en tamaño grande).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.74 1.21c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91S17.5 2 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.14c-.25.69-1.45 1.32-2 1.37-.51.05-.99.24-3.33-.69-2.82-1.12-4.6-4.01-4.74-4.2-.14-.19-1.13-1.5-1.13-2.86s.71-2.03.96-2.31c.25-.28.55-.35.73-.35h.52c.17 0 .39-.06.61.47.22.55.75 1.9.82 2.04.07.14.11.3.02.49-.09.19-.14.3-.28.47-.14.16-.29.36-.42.49-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.28.71 1.17 1.53 1.9 1.05.94 1.94 1.23 2.22 1.37.28.14.44.12.6-.07.16-.19.69-.8.88-1.08.19-.28.37-.23.63-.14.25.09 1.62.76 1.9.9.28.14.46.21.53.33.07.12.07.68-.18 1.37Z\"/></svg>Cotizar por WhatsApp</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:48px;padding:0 20px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--color-brand,#c8102e);color:var(--color-brand-ink,#fff);font-family:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,border-color 150ms,transform 150ms cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:var(--color-brand-hover,#a50d26)}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #111;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Botón secundario",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
